title: A view an extension puts in VS Code's panel is a tab next to "Console" in the console's title, not an icon of a bar: a click shows it and "Console" brings the consoles back; an icon of a bar goes into those tabs and back out to a bar, the card is still dragged by its title, goes into the side panel with its tabs, and no page is ever loaded again
folders: rust-small
extensions: webview-extension
limit: 150
forbid-log: WARN.*script
expect-file: rust-small/qa-pages.txt :: log holds 3 clicks and "in the console" after 1 load\(s\)
expect-file: ..\data\session.json :: "tabs": \[\s*"view:qa\.pad"
expect-file: ..\data\session.json :: "beside": "console"

wait 3000
ui click 1680 134
wait 2500
mark a-console-card-with-a-log-tab
wait 400
right qa.log
wait 2500
page window.qa.more()
page window.qa.write('in the console')
wait 400
mark b-the-log-tab
wait 400
ui click 1100 71
wait 1200
mark c-console-tab-shows-the-consoles
wait 400
ui click 1180 71
wait 1200
page window.qa.more()
wait 400
mark d-back-on-the-log
wait 400
move qa.pad console
wait 1500
right qa.pad
wait 2500
mark e-pad-moved-into-the-tabs
wait 400
ui right 1185 71
wait 900
mark f-the-tab-menu
wait 400
ui click 1240 120
wait 1500
mark g-pad-back-on-a-bar
wait 400
ui right 1680 206
wait 900
mark h-the-icon-menu
wait 400
ui click 1580 258
wait 1500
mark i-pad-in-the-tabs-again
wait 400
ui drag 1400 71 1000 200
wait 1200
mark j-the-card-dragged-by-its-title
wait 400
ui click 1545 20
wait 700
ui click 1500 226
wait 900
press escape
wait 1500
mark k-the-console-in-the-right-panel-with-its-tabs
wait 400
right qa.log
wait 1500
page window.qa.more()
wait 400
page window.qa.report()
wait 1200
mark l-the-log-tab-in-the-panel
wait 400
quit

=== again
wait 5000
mark m-after-a-restart
wait 500
quit
